tyle=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 12.95pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 205.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 12.95pt;\" width=\"274\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Associated benign tumours </strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 10.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 12.95pt;\" width=\"378\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Not applicable</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 205.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"274\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Cancer-related inheritance </span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 10.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"378\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Autosomal dominant</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 205.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"274\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Chromosome location</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 10.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"378\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em>CDH1 </em>(16q22.1)</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em>CTNNA1 </em>(5q31.2) (rare cases)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 6; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 205.55pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"274\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Protein product&ndash;associated pathway</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 10.0cm; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"378\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">E-cadherin, localized in adherens junctions, involved in cell&ndash;cell adhesion, tension sensing, mitotic spindle orientation, and signal transduction</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">&alpha;-Catenin, localized in adherens junctions, involved in &beta;-catenin/WNT signalling</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
