    "source": "",
    "copyright": "Reprinted from The Lancet Oncology, Volume 21, issue 8, Blair VB et al., Hereditary diffuse gastric cancer: updated clinical practice guidelines, Pages No. e386-e397, Copyright (2020), with permission from Elsevier",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 492.65pt; background: #DAEEF3; border-collapse: collapse; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" width=\"657\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 492.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"657\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Family criteria</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 32.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"43\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">1</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 460.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"614\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">&ge;&nbsp;2 cases of gastric cancer in a family regardless of age, with at least one DGC</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 32.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"43\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">2</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 460.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"614\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">&ge;&nbsp;1 cases of DGC at any age, and &ge;&nbsp;1 cases of LBC at age &lt;&nbsp;70&nbsp;years, in different family members</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 32.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"43\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">3</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 460.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"614\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">&ge;&nbsp;2 cases of LBC in family members, both diagnosed &lt;&nbsp;50&nbsp;years of age</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 492.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"657\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Individual criteria</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 32.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"43\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">4</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 460.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"614\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Isolated case of DGC at age &lt;&nbsp;50&nbsp;years</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 6; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 32.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"43\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">5</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 460.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"614\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">DGC at any age in individuals of Māori ethnicity</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 7; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 32.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"43\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">6</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 460.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"614\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">DGC at any age in individuals with a personal or family history (first-degree relative) of cleft lip or cleft palate</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 8; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 32.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"43\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">7</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 460.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"614\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">History of DGC and LBC, both diagnosed at age &lt;&nbsp;70&nbsp;years</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 9; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 32.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"43\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">8</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 460.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"614\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Bilateral LBC, diagnosed at age &lt;&nbsp;70&nbsp;years</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 10; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 32.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"43\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">9</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 460.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"614\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Gastric in&nbsp;situ signet-ring cells or pagetoid spread of signet-ring cells diagnosed &lt;&nbsp;50&nbsp;years of age</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">DGC, diffuse gastric cancer; LBC, lobular breast cancer.</p>",
